// Title: UAC Bypass Using Consent and Comctl32 - Process
// Rule ID: 1ca6bd18-0ba0-44ca-851c-92ed89a61085
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
